#: app/schemas.py:35
msgid ""
"File format invalid. Please ensure:\n"
"1. TITLE= is present with a title\n"
"2. TEXT= is present with text content\n"
"Use the official template."
msgstr ""
"Format file tidak valid. Harap pastikan:\n"
"1. TITLE= ada beserta judul\n"
"2. TEXT= ada beserta konten teks\n"
"Gunakan template resmi."

#: app/schemas.py:53
msgid ""
"Please provide content to summarize. You must either:\n"
"• Enter a title and text manually, OR\n"
"• Upload a file using the template format"
msgstr ""
"Harap berikan konten untuk diringkas. Anda harus:\n"
"• Memasukkan judul dan teks secara manual, ATAU\n"
"• Mengunggah berkas menggunakan format template"

#: app/schemas.py:56
msgid ""
"Title provided but no text content found. Please either:\n"
"• Enter text in the 'Original Text' field, OR\n"
"• Upload a file using the template format"
msgstr ""
"Judul diberikan tetapi tidak ada konten teks yang ditemukan. Harap:\n"
"• Memasukkan teks di kolom 'Teks Asli', ATAU\n"
"• Mengunggah berkas menggunakan format template"

#: app/schemas.py:60
msgid ""
"Uploaded file does not follow the template format. Please:\n"
"• Download the template file\n"
"• Fill it with TITLE= and TEXT= markers\n"
"• Upload the completed template"
msgstr ""
"Berkas yang diunggah tidak mengikuti format template. Harap:\n"
"• Mengunduh berkas template\n"
"• Mengisinya dengan penanda TITLE= dan TEXT=\n"
"• Mengunggah template yang telah diisi"

#: app/schemas.py:67
msgid "Text content is empty."
msgstr "Konten teks kosong."

#: app/schemas.py:72
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Text is too short for summarization. Please provide at least "
"%(min_words)d words (currently: %(word_count)d words)."
msgstr ""
"Teks terlalu pendek untuk diringkas. Harap berikan minimal %(min_words)d "
"kata (saat ini: %(word_count)d kata)."

#: app/schemas.py:78
msgid ""
"Text contains insufficient meaningful content. Please provide more "
"substantial text for summarization."
msgstr ""
"Teks mengandung konten bermakna yang tidak mencukupi. Harap berikan teks "
"yang lebih substansial untuk diringkas."

